COMMENT     On Oct 25, 2005 this sequence version replaced gi:345436.
            [FUNCTION] Plays a role in growth cones guidance.
            [SUBCELLULAR LOCATION] Membrane; Single-pass type I membrane
            protein.
            [TISSUE SPECIFICITY] Dynamically expressed on a subset of axon
            pathways in the developing CNS and on circumferential bands of
            epithelial cells in developing limb buds.
            [SIMILARITY] Belongs to the semaphorin family. {ECO:0000305}.
